cx:spaSpoPen_Potentiallyambiguousobjectrelativeclause_Meaning a rcxn:ConstructionMeaning ;
    rcxn:hasMeaning "Identificatory NP: [Someone]4 carries out a [transitive action]5 that affects [someone else]1. The function of the object relative clause is to identify the [affected]1." .

